# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for cppverify-sanitize.sh. Only the verifier's
# own code is instrumented; these are reports about code that is not, whose
# synchronization TSan cannot see.
#
# Z3's scoped_timer keeps a pool of timer threads and locks one state's mutex
# while it holds another's when timers nest. A state belongs to one timer at
# a time, so the two orders never meet; TSan relates the recycled instances.
deadlock:scoped_timer
# LLVM's RemoveFileOnSignal publishes each entry of its list with an atomic
# exchange in the uninstrumented Support library; DontRemoveFileOnSignal reads
# the entry after it.
race:llvm::sys::DontRemoveFileOnSignal
race:llvm::sys::RemoveFileOnSignal
